; `/etc/passwd` names nothing this repository owns, and that is the
; point: the import is refused for its SHAPE, before any file is
; looked for. Before AX2006 an absolute module name was concatenated
; onto each search directory in turn, which an absolute path simply
; re-anchors - `axiom check` on a file importing one outside the
; project printed OK and compiled that file into the program.
(import /etc/passwd)

(:: main Int)
(fn (main) 0)
